<title>POLAND: STOMIL SEPT NET EASES TO PLN 6.3 MLN.</title>
<headline>STOMIL SEPT NET EASES TO PLN 6.3 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-10-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results September</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>SEPTEMBER</p>
<p> Net profit	     6.28 vs   6.72</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 9.42 vs   8.98</p>
<p> Operating profit     9.72 vs   8.54</p>
<p> Sales		   71.13 vs  50.22</p>
<p>JANUARY-SEPTEMBER</p>
<p> Net profit	    39.56 vs  54.28</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	60.19 vs  64.84</p>
<p> Operating profit    54.32 vs  64.72</p>
<p> Sales		  509.41 vs 386.65</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish tyre maker is Stomil Olsztyn SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
